00:14:16.490 --> 00:14:17.170
He did.

292
00:14:17.170 --> 00:14:18.370
Because that's Mike Schur.

293
00:14:18.530 --> 00:14:21.650
This is 100% from the brain of Mike Schur.

294
00:14:21.790 --> 00:14:25.690
He did such a good job of writing these Jim Dwight pranks.

295
00:14:25.810 --> 00:14:26.970
Oh, he's so smart, Jenna.

296
00:14:27.210 --> 00:14:27.950
He's so smart.

297
00:14:28.090 --> 00:14:28.370
I know.

298
00:14:28.690 --> 00:14:29.110
He's smarty.

299
00:14:29.470 --> 00:14:29.610
Yeah.

300
00:14:29.610 --> 00:14:30.070
All right.

