00:14:30.230 --> 00:14:33.570
So then we move into the episode and Michael is at his desk.

302
00:14:33.870 --> 00:14:34.730
Jan enters.

303
00:14:35.210 --> 00:14:36.270
Oh, Michael.

304
00:14:36.690 --> 00:14:38.430
Again, like three hellos.

305
00:14:38.590 --> 00:14:40.910
Just call me Levinson in the morning.

306
00:14:40.910 --> 00:14:43.270
In the morning, Levinson's.

