00:15:10.670 --> 00:15:16.330
Everyone from outside the office can see and hear that something is going down in his office.

320
00:15:16.530 --> 00:15:17.650
Everyone's very curious.

321
00:15:17.650 --> 00:15:22.030
Yes, because he's like, like he's moaning.

