00:18:53.350 --> 00:18:54.370
I have.

406
00:18:54.690 --> 00:18:56.270
Or if you've ever been fired.

407
00:18:56.490 --> 00:18:59.350
But I couldn't imagine getting the news Michael got.

408
00:18:59.530 --> 00:19:06.710
And Jan's like, well, you know, they believe that Josh Porter is going to have a big role in the future of the company.

409
00:19:06.710 --> 00:19:09.090
And Michael goes, what kind of role?

410
00:19:09.230 --> 00:19:10.850
King of the king of the stupid universe.

411
00:19:11.770 --> 00:19:12.290
Yeah.

412
00:19:13.070 --> 00:19:14.130
Could you imagine?

413
00:19:14.630 --> 00:19:19.310
Like firing someone, basically, who's having this kind of a spiral?

414
00:19:19.650 --> 00:19:19.910
I mean.

415
00:19:20.170 --> 00:19:26.150
Could you imagine firing someone or being fired and then having their wind up mechanical teeth?

416
00:19:26.170 --> 00:19:27.090
Was that in the script?

417
00:19:27.370 --> 00:19:28.330
It was an accident.

418
00:19:28.330 --> 00:19:39.170
And by the way, this points to what amazing actors Steve and Melora are, because they just stayed in the moment and reacted to it as if that was meant to happen.

419
00:19:39.170 --> 00:19:40.650
It was not meant to happen.

420
00:19:41.030 --> 00:19:50.010
And could it be more brilliant that you're firing this guy who's so incompetent on so many levels and his clacky teeth go off?

421
00:19:51.270 --> 00:19:51.810
Yes.

422
00:19:52.650 --> 00:19:53.190
Amazing.

423
00:19:53.810 --> 00:19:54.150
All right.

424
00:19:54.470 --> 00:19:55.790
I'm going to move us along.

