00:20:19.850 --> 00:20:22.430
Did she knit that whole scarf her character is working on?

433
00:20:22.670 --> 00:20:25.390
You guys, she is 100% fake knitting.

434
00:20:25.670 --> 00:20:26.710
Phyllis cannot knit.

