00:23:43.670 --> 00:23:48.930
If you freeze and look closely on that big board that's hanging by accounting,

494
00:23:49.210 --> 00:23:51.830
on Tuesday the 5th, it says,

495
00:23:52.750 --> 00:23:56.490
One of many Emmys, Steve, was robbed.

496
00:23:56.490 --> 00:24:00.430
